[3.06, "o", "\r\n"]
[3.56, "o", "# After-Action Review \u2014 hello-demo-agent\r\n"]
[3.68, "o", "## 1. What was the goal?\r\n"]
[3.8, "o", "Add JWT authentication to the `/login` endpoint without breaking the\r\n"]
[3.92, "o", "existing session middleware.\r\n"]
[4.04, "o", "The agent was instructed to slot JWT in alongside an existing session\r\n"]
[4.16, "o", "system. The task was scoped narrowly (one endpoint, one concern), but\r\n"]
[4.28, "o", "the implicit contract \u2014 *don't break the middleware* \u2014 required\r\n"]
[4.4, "o", "understanding two systems before touching either.\r\n"]
[4.52, "o", "## 2. What actually happened?\r\n"]
[4.64, "o", "The agent moved straight from \"grep\" to \"edit\" without reading the\r\n"]
[4.76, "o", "session middleware in full. The first patch broke a session-coupling\r\n"]
[4.88, "o", "test. The agent then tried to satisfy both the new JWT path and the\r\n"]
[5.0, "o", "old session cookie path in the same response object, which broke a\r\n"]
[5.12, "o", "second test (logout) because the middleware now re-wrote the cookie\r\n"]
[5.24, "o", "on every response.\r\n"]
[5.36, "o", "The agent never investigated the failing test's expectation, never\r\n"]
[5.48, "o", "read the middleware's response-side logic, and ended by reverting\r\n"]
[5.6, "o", "without surfacing the upstream cause.\r\n"]
[5.72, "o", "ilhan@vstack ~ $ "]
